---
const docsUrl = 'https://github.com/Fita-data/fita-docs';
const repoUrl = 'https://github.com/Fita-data/fita';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Fita is an open source master data management engine."
		/>
		<title>Fita</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>Fita</h1>
			<p class="lead">
				Open source master data management. One golden record per customer and
				supplier, built from the systems you already have, with the source of
				every value.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Reads databases, files and applications. Read only.</li>
				<li>Finds the records that describe the same entity.</li>
				<li>Keeps the source of every value. Every automatic decision can be undone.</li>
				<li>Serves the result through a REST API, exports and an MCP server for AI agents.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Fita is in early development. Expect breaking changes until v1.0.</p>
			<p class="links">
				<a href={repoUrl}>GitHub</a>
				<a href={docsUrl}>Documentation</a>
			</p>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
	:root {
		color-scheme: light dark;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	main {
		max-width: 40rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 4rem 1rem;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
	}
	.lead {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
	}
	.links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}
</style>
